{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":750326,"ns":0,"title":"Compact group","extract":"In mathematics, a compact (topological) group is a topological group whose topology realizes it as a compact topological space. Compact groups are a natural generalization of finite groups with the discrete topology and have properties that carry over in significant fashion.","description":"Topological group with compact topology","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}